{
 "rc": {
  "cells": [
   {
    "id": "bg",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "0pt",
    "y": "0pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}",
    "h": "{parent.h}",
    "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
   },
   {
    "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。⚠️ 色值恒 #2E9E6B|#45C793,**不跟事项的调色板走** —— 这颗点答的是「这是 checkin 的卡」,不是「这件事是紫色的」;跟着 pal 变会让同一个包在盘上看着像六个源。⚠️ y 引用顶层的 nm2(不带图标那份名字,带图标时 hide 但照样布局,与 nm1 同 y 同字号):锚点不能落进 op:if 分支,否则另一档整卡算不出来(2026-10-03 第一行统一)。",
    "id": "dot",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "{nm2.y}+({nm2.h}-5pt)/2",
    "w": "5pt",
    "h": "5pt",
    "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "2.5pt",
     "leftB": "2.5pt",
     "rightT": "2.5pt",
     "rightB": "2.5pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "op",
    "action": "if",
    "props": {
     "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hicon},1),1,0)]"
    },
    "react": [
     {
      "id": "ic",
      "type": "img",
      "x": "23pt",
      "y": "10pt",
      "w": "16pt",
      "h": "16pt",
      "url": "@[file://xWidget/assets/ic/${icon}.$[if::(eq::(${theme},dark),d,l)].uri]"
     },
     {
      "id": "nm1",
      "type": "txt",
      "x": "{ic.r}+5pt",
      "y": "12pt",
      "w": "{parent.w}-141pt-{ic.w}-5pt",
      "h": "-1",
      "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${iname},${@i18n.pickItem})]",
      "fontSize": "13pt",
      "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
      "maxLines": "1",
      "typeface": "System-Bold"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "nm2",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "23pt",
    "y": "12pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-141pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${iname},${@i18n.pickItem})]",
    "fontSize": "13pt",
    "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "typeface": "System-Bold",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${hicon},1),1,0)]"
   },
   {
    "_note": "右上合计:单位按类型分叉(天/次);空态兜 --。⚠️ mask=1 时这一格改渲状态标记(totM)而不是「•• 次」——「•• 次」读不出东西,而「为什么全是点」正是打码态唯一要回答的问题(打码 ≠ 空态:空态是 `--` 加事实陈述,打码是主动语态的一句状态,card-design-system §5.2)。两个态各一个 cell 各自 hide。",
    "id": "tot",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-110pt",
    "y": "12.5pt",
    "w": "96pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "$[connect::(findNotEmpty::(${total},--),if::(eq::(${ck},1),${@i18n.sufD},${@i18n.sufT}))]",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "alignmentH": "2",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),1,0)]"
   },
   {
    "id": "totM",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-110pt",
    "y": "12.5pt",
    "w": "96pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.masked}",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "alignmentH": "2",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,1)]"
   },
   {
    "id": "lbl",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "35pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-142pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.window}",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "_note": "日期锚(标准 §4.4):371 格里没有一个数字带日期,不写窗口起止就分不出这张卡是今天渲的还是上个月的(封面缓存 key 不含时间维度)。右对齐,与 lbl 同一行、各占一半。",
    "id": "rng",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-124pt",
    "y": "35.5pt",
    "w": "110pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${y0Lbl},--)] – $[findNotEmpty::(${y1Lbl},--)]",
    "fontSize": "9pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "alignmentH": "2"
   },
